WEBVTT

01:31.660 --> 01:34.990
[NORTHWARD]

01:35.140 --> 01:36.970
[Episode 4]

01:39.630 --> 01:40.430
Cut it thinner.

01:45.970 --> 01:48.060
Are you braising it or stir-frying it?

01:48.660 --> 01:49.479
Braising.

01:49.630 --> 01:51.479
You're using such high heat for braising?

01:51.500 --> 01:52.259
Alright. Got it.

01:52.520 --> 01:53.950
Control the heat.

01:54.500 --> 01:55.380
Boss!

01:55.670 --> 01:56.729
Someone's looking for you.

02:02.130 --> 02:03.180
Our boss is here.

02:04.150 --> 02:04.710
Siyi.

02:04.740 --> 02:05.670
Uncle Zhou.

02:05.760 --> 02:06.640
Why are you here?

02:07.230 --> 02:10.210
I'm here to find a job.

02:10.229 --> 02:11.220
A part-time job.

02:11.630 --> 02:14.720
I can wash dishes, serve tables, and sweep floors.

02:15.110 --> 02:15.860
Except for cooking,

02:15.910 --> 02:16.710
I can basically do all the other jobs.

02:16.710 --> 02:17.990
H-Hold on a second.

02:18.680 --> 02:20.410
What's wrong? What happened?

02:21.310 --> 02:23.530
Besides, I can come to work every weekend.

02:23.550 --> 02:25.230
I'll also take half the usual wage.

02:25.410 --> 02:28.480
It's just I was wondering if I could get an advance payment.

02:30.680 --> 02:31.620
An advance payment?

02:32.660 --> 02:33.420
How much do you want?

02:33.670 --> 02:34.820
4,700.

02:35.700 --> 02:37.510
Why such an odd amount?

02:39.040 --> 02:40.240
What exactly happened?

02:47.079 --> 02:48.800
I can lend you the money,

02:48.890 --> 02:49.840
Siyi,

02:50.120 --> 02:51.440
but I can't offer you a job.

02:52.110 --> 02:52.960
Why?

02:53.230 --> 02:54.250
You tell me.

02:54.470 --> 02:55.190
You're in your final year of senior high school.

02:55.790 --> 02:57.030
Your only task right now

02:57.030 --> 02:58.510
is to study hard,

02:58.530 --> 02:59.290
okay?

02:59.890 --> 03:00.710
Never mind then.

03:00.860 --> 03:02.470
If you can't give me a job,

03:02.470 --> 03:03.750
I'll try somewhere else.

03:04.230 --> 03:06.190
Don't tell Grandma about this.

03:06.670 --> 03:07.670
Sorry for bothering you.

03:08.480 --> 03:09.360
Stop there.

03:14.520 --> 03:16.530
Even your grandma doesn't know about this?

03:18.880 --> 03:20.590
What exactly happened?

03:24.230 --> 03:25.450
It's your mother who needs the money,

03:25.750 --> 03:26.470
right?

03:34.550 --> 03:35.350
How about this?

03:36.470 --> 03:37.300
You can come here on weekends

03:38.920 --> 03:40.790
and see if there's anything you can help with.

03:41.610 --> 03:42.550
But

03:43.030 --> 03:43.790
when there's no work to do,

03:43.810 --> 03:45.329
be good and do your homework properly.

03:46.780 --> 03:47.430
Okay.

03:47.450 --> 03:48.329
Alright?

03:48.800 --> 03:49.600
Thank you, Uncle Zhou.

03:49.640 --> 03:50.630
You're welcome.

03:50.990 --> 03:51.980
Give me the money.

03:54.510 --> 03:55.150
Come back!

03:56.730 --> 04:00.740
[By the Canal]

03:58.950 --> 04:00.110
You haven't taken the money yet.

04:01.570 --> 04:02.380
Here you are.

04:03.070 --> 04:03.780
You didn't even take the money.

04:03.820 --> 04:04.870
Are you trying to learn from Lei Feng?

04:04.910 --> 04:05.660
Thank you.

04:06.090 --> 04:07.270
This kid.

04:09.180 --> 04:10.980
Your teacher called me today,

04:12.280 --> 04:13.630
saying that during class,

04:13.630 --> 04:16.680
you were using Morse code to send secret messages to a female classmate.

04:17.839 --> 04:18.970
Is that true?

04:21.459 --> 04:22.260
Why are you smiling?

04:22.660 --> 04:23.750
Did you teach him that?

04:25.160 --> 04:25.900
It's not like that.

04:26.200 --> 04:27.190
I only taught him that

04:27.190 --> 04:28.830
as a hobby.

04:28.850 --> 04:31.690
How was I supposed to know he'd use it for this?

04:35.409 --> 04:36.440
Which classmate?

04:38.720 --> 04:39.520
Ma Siyi?

04:43.909 --> 04:45.270
It's a bit too early.

04:45.950 --> 04:47.710
Is this how you teach children?

04:47.940 --> 04:48.960
No dinner for you.

04:52.770 --> 04:53.840
You eat.

04:54.980 --> 04:56.110
Don't let this happen again.

04:59.230 --> 05:00.950
Haven't I told you

05:01.060 --> 05:03.810
not to hang out with those who play around all day?

05:04.060 --> 05:05.320
Ma Siyi is alright.

05:05.340 --> 05:06.260
She got into No. 1 High School.

05:06.300 --> 05:07.510
Her grades are pretty good.

05:07.550 --> 05:09.030
But look at those other kids.

05:09.350 --> 05:11.530
They'll affect your grades.

05:12.160 --> 05:14.410
It's not that serious.

05:14.860 --> 05:16.600
Those kids are all pretty decent.

05:24.360 --> 05:24.920
Eat your meal.

05:26.930 --> 05:28.090
Don't push the bike any further.

05:28.110 --> 05:29.350
It's too noisy. Just leave it there.

05:29.390 --> 05:30.110
Okay.

05:31.330 --> 05:32.760
This way. Over here.

05:33.720 --> 05:34.320
Right here.

05:34.360 --> 05:35.150
This one.

05:36.400 --> 05:37.950
Are you sure this ship is unclaimed?

05:37.990 --> 05:39.120
We don't want to get caught later.

05:39.150 --> 05:39.950
Don't worry.

05:39.990 --> 05:40.870
I'll go down and take a look.

05:40.909 --> 05:41.430
No, no.

05:41.430 --> 05:42.190
I'll go. I'll go.

05:42.190 --> 05:43.240
Hold this for me.

05:43.520 --> 05:44.490
Be careful.

05:44.520 --> 05:45.110
Shine the flashlight for me.

05:45.110 --> 05:45.630
Be careful.

05:45.750 --> 05:46.870
Be careful.

05:46.900 --> 05:47.570
Slowly.

05:47.800 --> 05:48.400
It's okay.

05:49.740 --> 05:50.470
Be careful.

05:50.470 --> 05:51.550
Give me the bucket.

05:52.920 --> 05:53.900
Here.

05:54.340 --> 05:55.620
Check if there's any over there.

05:55.640 --> 05:56.740
Shine some light for him.

05:57.280 --> 05:57.800
Be careful.

05:57.800 --> 05:58.830
Be careful, Wanghe.

05:58.830 --> 05:59.710
Are you alright?

06:01.280 --> 06:02.330
Be careful.

06:08.190 --> 06:08.910
How is it? Did you find any?

06:08.950 --> 06:09.630
Is there any?

06:10.470 --> 06:11.780
Yes, a lot.

06:11.910 --> 06:12.870
Here, here.

06:13.340 --> 06:15.000
Give him the bucket.

06:15.530 --> 06:16.810
Keep an eye out for people.

06:16.850 --> 06:17.950
I'm going down.

06:18.480 --> 06:19.360
Give him this bucket too.

06:19.380 --> 06:20.310
I'll take this.

06:21.840 --> 06:22.510
Wanghe!

06:22.550 --> 06:23.070
Wanghe!

06:23.340 --> 06:24.460
The police are here. Run!

06:24.510 --> 06:25.190
Hurry up!

06:25.190 --> 06:25.940
Go that way!

06:25.990 --> 06:26.910
Run!

06:26.950 --> 06:28.000
Leave it, leave it!

06:28.760 --> 06:29.560
Go that way!

06:29.600 --> 06:30.280
Stop right there!

06:30.500 --> 06:31.110
Go that way!

06:31.110 --> 06:31.910
Go that way!

06:32.480 --> 06:33.450
There are more people down there!

06:34.409 --> 06:35.500
Stop!

06:36.190 --> 06:37.180
Freeze!

06:37.210 --> 06:38.580
Run! Haikuo!

06:38.950 --> 06:39.640
Don't run!

06:39.830 --> 06:40.510
Go that way!

06:40.550 --> 06:41.150
Run!

06:41.170 --> 06:41.940
Stop there!

06:42.030 --> 06:43.370
Go that way! Go that way!

06:43.500 --> 06:44.790
Go that way!

06:51.710 --> 06:52.550
Stop!

06:55.670 --> 06:56.500
Freeze!

06:57.490 --> 06:58.530
We were just passing by.

06:58.550 --> 06:59.470
We were just passing by!

06:59.500 --> 07:00.300
We didn't do anything!

07:00.360 --> 07:01.460
You little brat.

07:02.600 --> 07:04.910
Officer, I was just passing by.

07:04.910 --> 07:06.670
Passing by? Passing by with an oil bucket?

07:06.670 --> 07:07.520
You know what?

07:07.550 --> 07:08.700
There have been a lot of oil thieves lately.

07:08.740 --> 07:10.060
It's not just you guys.

07:11.160 --> 07:11.990
Sir. Sir.

07:12.100 --> 07:12.950
Please, I'm begging you.

07:12.970 --> 07:14.430
I'm still in school.

07:14.450 --> 07:15.540
I'll get expelled.

07:15.580 --> 07:16.900
Now you remember you're a student?

07:17.210 --> 07:17.920
Get in!

07:30.060 --> 07:31.460
What do we do now?

07:33.010 --> 07:34.200
How about

07:34.659 --> 07:36.340
we call Chen Rui

07:36.360 --> 07:38.030
and let him ask his mom to find a way to bail Wanghe out?

07:38.050 --> 07:40.810
Right. His mother is the district chief. She must know the police.

07:40.840 --> 07:42.290
What if his mom refuses?

07:42.330 --> 07:43.920
We won't know if we don't try.

07:43.940 --> 07:45.030
If Wanghe gets detained today,

07:45.110 --> 07:46.670
his dad might beat him to death.

07:58.950 --> 07:59.460
Hello?

08:01.130 --> 08:01.920
You want to speak to Chen Rui?

08:01.940 --> 08:02.780
He's at home.

08:04.720 --> 08:05.600
Who is it?

08:05.910 --> 08:06.590
Hello?

08:06.590 --> 08:07.300
I don't know.

08:07.870 --> 08:09.470
You didn't even ask who it was.

08:11.330 --> 08:13.980
Don't be too strict with the kid.

08:14.020 --> 08:15.410
It's just a phone call.

08:15.880 --> 08:17.010
Who allowed you to sit here?

08:21.070 --> 08:21.870
What happened?

08:23.380 --> 08:25.320
My friend got arrested by the police.

08:25.400 --> 08:26.480
Who?

08:26.510 --> 08:27.600
Which friend?

08:27.630 --> 08:28.500
What for?

08:28.670 --> 08:30.350
It must be a misunderstanding.

08:31.740 --> 08:32.570
Why did he call you?

08:38.950 --> 08:40.539
They want me to help?

08:40.600 --> 08:43.210
Do you think I'm going to the police station to bail someone out for you?

08:55.350 --> 08:57.250
You've done this kind of thing many times before, haven't you?

08:57.530 --> 08:58.340
No.

08:58.910 --> 09:00.110
This is the first time.

09:00.940 --> 09:01.700
Sir.

09:02.160 --> 09:04.100
Please let me go.

09:04.670 --> 09:05.990
I won't dare to do it again.

09:06.020 --> 09:07.340
Now you're begging for mercy?

09:07.360 --> 09:08.620
It's a bit too late for that, don't you think?

09:08.790 --> 09:10.360
You're not a child anymore.

09:10.470 --> 09:12.430
You think you can just get away with it?

09:14.590 --> 09:15.310
Sir.

09:15.310 --> 09:16.790
Why don't you just beat me up

09:16.800 --> 09:18.920
and consider it my punishment?

09:19.810 --> 09:21.300
If I

09:21.790 --> 09:23.900
personally send you to prison,

09:23.990 --> 09:25.310
when your father finds out,

09:25.310 --> 09:26.950
I suppose his expression would be quite amusing.

09:28.680 --> 09:29.970
You know my father?

09:30.490 --> 09:31.770
More than just knowing him.

09:32.650 --> 09:34.720
Your father and I have a bit of a past.

09:36.500 --> 09:38.790
Your father used to bully me a lot when we were kids.

09:38.880 --> 09:40.070
He'd corner me every day

09:40.070 --> 09:40.990
and take my stuff.

09:41.060 --> 09:42.970
I got beaten up by him quite a lot.

09:57.870 --> 09:59.340
Do you think there's a chance?

09:59.510 --> 10:00.910
I don't know.

10:01.500 --> 10:03.010
But Chen Rui is quite loyal to friends.

10:03.040 --> 10:04.220
I think he'll do his best.

10:05.100 --> 10:06.790
Let's take it one step at a time.

10:09.670 --> 10:11.660
The college entrance exam is just around the corner.

10:11.680 --> 10:13.160
If something goes wrong,

10:13.270 --> 10:15.120
his life will be ruined!

10:16.300 --> 10:17.280
This won't do.

10:17.300 --> 10:18.390
I'll go find him.

10:18.510 --> 10:19.410
What do you want to do?

10:19.550 --> 10:19.950
Let go of me!

10:19.950 --> 10:20.390
You can't go!

10:20.390 --> 10:21.080
You'll only make things worse!

10:21.110 --> 10:21.500
Let go of me!

10:21.500 --> 10:22.640
-Don't be anxious.
-It's useless to be anxious.

10:22.670 --> 10:23.310
Fenghua...

10:30.230 --> 10:31.140
It's okay, Fenghua.

10:31.170 --> 10:32.940
There's no point in being anxious now.

10:36.090 --> 10:37.200
Tell me.

10:38.110 --> 10:41.060
If I had insisted on not letting you go out today,

10:41.190 --> 10:43.140
would he have avoided this trouble?

10:43.500 --> 10:44.510
No.

10:45.010 --> 10:46.270
It was everyone's decision.

10:46.300 --> 10:47.090
It wasn't your fault.

10:47.390 --> 10:48.750
You couldn't have stopped us.

10:50.980 --> 10:52.570
If Wanghe really gets detained,

10:53.340 --> 10:54.370
I'll drop out of school!

10:55.300 --> 10:56.340
They say

10:56.480 --> 10:58.220
life in prison is extremely hard.

10:58.360 --> 11:00.860
Without money, it's impossible to get by.

11:01.540 --> 11:03.140
If his parents give up on him,

11:03.280 --> 11:04.430
I'll take care of him.

11:08.390 --> 11:09.650
I believe Chen Rui

11:09.860 --> 11:11.180
will take it seriously.

11:11.300 --> 11:12.800
He should be working on it already.

11:12.830 --> 11:14.740
We might as well go home and wait for news.

11:14.950 --> 11:16.100
Let's go home first.

11:16.760 --> 11:17.880
Wanghe is a lucky boy.

11:18.040 --> 11:19.720
He always manages to turn bad luck into good.

11:55.710 --> 11:56.910
Where are you going?

11:57.210 --> 11:57.850
Get back here!

11:57.870 --> 11:58.680
I'll be right back, Mom.

11:58.710 --> 11:59.990
Chen Rui, stop right there!

12:00.270 --> 12:01.310
Mom, I'll be back in no time.

12:01.350 --> 12:01.910
I promise.

12:01.950 --> 12:02.750
What do you want to do?

12:02.770 --> 12:04.090
I just want to go check on him.

12:04.120 --> 12:04.920
Are you going to bail him out?

12:05.790 --> 12:07.150
I'm not capable of that, Mom.

12:07.150 --> 12:08.510
He's my best friend.

12:08.510 --> 12:09.310
Even if I can't help,

12:09.350 --> 12:10.390
I have to be there.

12:10.390 --> 12:11.230
I won't allow it.

12:11.470 --> 12:12.150
Please, Mom.

12:12.150 --> 12:12.710
I'll really be quick.

12:12.730 --> 12:13.390
Come home with me.

12:13.390 --> 12:14.190
I'll be back...

12:14.230 --> 12:15.470
I'll be back right away.

12:15.470 --> 12:15.990
Mom.

12:16.030 --> 12:17.150
Stop pulling and tugging.

12:17.150 --> 12:18.510
What if the neighbors see?

12:18.510 --> 12:19.900
Alright, keep your voice down.

12:21.910 --> 12:22.670
Son!

12:23.270 --> 12:24.030
Son!

12:24.720 --> 12:26.120
Where are you hurt?

12:27.460 --> 12:28.840
Keep it down.

12:43.030 --> 12:43.850
Are you hungry?

12:47.360 --> 12:48.870
You'd better eat something first.

12:48.950 --> 12:50.110
Once you get there,

12:50.110 --> 12:51.750
there's not much to eat at the police station.

12:56.920 --> 12:57.380
[Police]

13:01.710 --> 13:02.150
Come on.

13:02.160 --> 13:02.920
Get off.

13:09.010 --> 13:09.740
Let's go.

13:09.940 --> 13:14.950
[Police]

13:21.880 --> 13:22.640
Sit here.

13:30.190 --> 13:31.940
I want a Stir-fried Shredded Pork with Green Pepper,

13:32.550 --> 13:33.880
a Fried Stinky Tofu,

13:34.990 --> 13:36.840
and a Cold Beef Salad.

13:37.720 --> 13:39.340
Two bottles of drinks.

13:39.380 --> 13:40.850
Make sure they're ice-cold.

13:39.410 --> 13:41.620
[Public Toilet]

13:46.310 --> 13:48.810
Why are they eating?

13:48.950 --> 13:50.530
What's going on?

13:52.050 --> 13:53.450
Let's go up. That way.

14:09.600 --> 14:10.440
Don't just sit there.

14:10.740 --> 14:11.440
Eat.

14:21.770 --> 14:23.420
How are your grades?

14:24.510 --> 14:26.060
I'm ranked third in the whole grade,

14:27.680 --> 14:28.630
to last.

14:31.000 --> 14:32.290
Doesn't your dad beat you?

14:32.370 --> 14:33.290
He does.

14:33.980 --> 14:35.140
He's been beating me since I was little.

14:35.320 --> 14:36.840
He's broken several belts beating me.

14:37.620 --> 14:39.250
But later he found that beating me was useless,

14:39.270 --> 14:40.640
so he gave up.

14:40.910 --> 14:42.510
And you started to give up on yourself.

14:44.210 --> 14:45.310
It's not that bad.

14:45.870 --> 14:47.160
My grades are poor

14:48.960 --> 14:50.570
because my mind isn't on it.

14:50.860 --> 14:51.980
Where is your mind then?

14:52.000 --> 14:53.060
Making money.

14:53.690 --> 14:55.210
You are still a kid.

14:55.670 --> 14:57.310
Why are you thinking about making money at such an early age?

14:57.350 --> 14:58.520
Let me tell you.

14:58.620 --> 14:59.610
It's not too late

15:00.160 --> 15:01.280
to think about this kind of thing

15:01.320 --> 15:02.430
in a few years.

15:02.450 --> 15:04.110
It'll be too late then, Uncle.

15:04.870 --> 15:07.040
Before the Beijing-Shanghai High Speed Railway was put into operation,

15:07.070 --> 15:08.580
river transport was really booming.

15:08.610 --> 15:09.890
My dad has a ship.

15:09.910 --> 15:11.450
He used to make money off of it easily.

15:11.990 --> 15:13.010
But now,

15:13.190 --> 15:15.220
breaking even is considered a victory.

15:15.240 --> 15:16.680
My dad used to be so impressive.

15:16.720 --> 15:18.940
Wherever he went, people would offer him cigarettes.

15:18.970 --> 15:20.480
Everyone called him 'boss.'

15:20.520 --> 15:21.460
But what about now?

15:21.710 --> 15:23.440
Now he's the one offering cigarettes to others wherever he goes.

15:23.730 --> 15:25.220
Every time he sees contractors,

15:25.240 --> 15:26.640
he grovels to them.

15:26.660 --> 15:27.880
He's not manly at all.

15:28.340 --> 15:29.760
Don't you dare talk more nonsense!

15:49.090 --> 15:50.500
When I was a kid,

15:51.760 --> 15:52.850
your father

15:52.880 --> 15:54.600
used to set up a stall at the old pier,

15:54.610 --> 15:55.920
selling fish and shrimp.

15:56.590 --> 15:58.710
Every day, he'd get up before dawn

15:59.540 --> 16:01.200
and take the best spot.

16:02.700 --> 16:04.100
Only after he finished selling

16:04.130 --> 16:05.750
would he let others sell there.

16:06.410 --> 16:07.850
By the time I set up my stall,

16:07.880 --> 16:09.260
the fish and shrimp would already be dead.

16:09.560 --> 16:10.800
At that time,

16:10.840 --> 16:12.820
the person I disliked the most was your father.

16:17.710 --> 16:19.340
I remember when I was in my senior year of high school,

16:20.490 --> 16:22.110
my mother fell ill.

16:22.650 --> 16:23.910
No one in my family could take care of her,

16:23.940 --> 16:25.700
so I had to drop out of school to look after her.

16:26.520 --> 16:27.660
Later, I don't know who

16:27.660 --> 16:29.230
told your father about this,

16:30.680 --> 16:31.870
but one night, your father

16:31.870 --> 16:33.740
suddenly came to my house.

16:33.770 --> 16:35.180
I didn't dare to open the door.

16:35.820 --> 16:38.030
Unexpectedly, he kicked the door open with a bang.

16:43.530 --> 16:45.130
What do you want, Xie Tiancheng?

17:04.839 --> 17:06.400
At first, I thought

17:06.400 --> 17:07.990
it contained bricks.

17:08.619 --> 17:10.819
I only realized after I opened it that

17:11.170 --> 17:13.099
it was filled with cash.

17:14.960 --> 17:16.710
A full 600 yuan.

17:17.880 --> 17:19.470
It was 1987.

17:20.349 --> 17:22.280
That was a huge sum of money back then.

17:23.700 --> 17:26.050
I was completely stunned at the time.

17:26.099 --> 17:28.099
I had no idea what he was up to.

17:28.580 --> 17:30.190
Guess what your father said to me at that time.

17:32.350 --> 17:34.040
He pointed at me and said, 'Kid,

17:34.690 --> 17:36.360
don't you drop out of school.

17:36.470 --> 17:38.030
Take this money and hire a caregiver.

17:38.030 --> 17:38.750
If it's not enough,

17:38.750 --> 17:39.630
let me know.'

17:44.650 --> 17:46.380
I was completely dumbfounded at that moment.

17:48.390 --> 17:49.440
Get into a good university

17:49.470 --> 17:51.030
and find a decent job.

17:51.990 --> 17:53.770
Things like street vending

17:53.990 --> 17:54.750
are not for you.

17:56.970 --> 17:57.720
Thank you.

18:23.260 --> 18:24.590
During that time my mom was ill,

18:25.440 --> 18:27.880
it cost us about 2,000 yuan in total.

18:29.420 --> 18:31.010
During her entire hospital stay,

18:31.150 --> 18:32.080
your dad

18:32.590 --> 18:34.590
and his friends

18:34.840 --> 18:36.540
took turns taking care of my mom.

18:36.710 --> 18:38.330
Every time your dad came,

18:39.710 --> 18:41.860
he'd bring the soup he made

18:41.900 --> 18:43.460
for my mom with the fish he caught.

18:45.170 --> 18:47.010
When my mom was discharged,

18:47.030 --> 18:48.030
she secretly told me that

18:49.140 --> 18:51.320
she'd never want to eat fish again in her life,

18:51.340 --> 18:52.360
that she had had enough.

18:56.440 --> 18:57.730
Kid.

18:58.970 --> 19:01.690
Your dad was a jerk back then.

19:01.830 --> 19:03.580
Of course, he still is now.

19:04.070 --> 19:05.580
But in his life,

19:06.810 --> 19:08.350
he's never owed anyone favors.

19:08.790 --> 19:10.700
It's always others who owe him.

19:13.050 --> 19:14.750
You're in your rebellious phase now.

19:14.840 --> 19:17.510
You may be annoyed by him, and you may look down on him.

19:17.550 --> 19:18.650
That's all normal.

19:20.090 --> 19:22.060
But I hope you can understand that

19:22.660 --> 19:24.260
no matter when,

19:25.990 --> 19:28.510
and no matter what you become,

19:29.360 --> 19:30.810
your dad is, and will always be,

19:30.860 --> 19:32.790
a man of great integrity.

19:37.260 --> 19:38.370
In the past,

19:38.710 --> 19:40.590
your dad never brought shame to you.

19:41.560 --> 19:42.530
In the future,

19:43.230 --> 19:45.570
I hope you won't bring shame to your dad either.

19:58.280 --> 20:00.270
If you dare to be such a jerk again,

20:01.140 --> 20:03.120
I'll break your legs myself.

20:13.940 --> 20:15.450
Boss, bill please.

20:17.030 --> 20:17.930
Thank you.

20:26.360 --> 20:28.920
It's truly a case of "raising a father for a lifetime and using him for a moment."

20:29.000 --> 20:29.960
Wanghe.

20:29.990 --> 20:32.420
You must kowtow to your father when you get back.

20:33.070 --> 20:33.870
Tell me about it.

20:33.910 --> 20:35.920
Uncle Xie is no ordinary man.

20:35.940 --> 20:37.780
In the early years of seafaring, there were scammers

20:37.810 --> 20:39.160
who put fishing nets deep in the river.

20:39.190 --> 20:41.770
When a ship passed by, they'd rush out demanding compensation.

20:41.940 --> 20:42.970
But our ships

20:43.000 --> 20:44.320
have never been stopped, not even once.

20:44.340 --> 20:46.130
Everyone knows Boss Xie isn't someone to mess with.

20:46.300 --> 20:47.740
That's really true.

20:47.910 --> 20:48.710
Wanghe.

20:48.740 --> 20:51.050
Back in the day, your father was like Ghost Foot Seven.

20:51.470 --> 20:52.790
Your dad is Ghost Foot Seven.

20:52.830 --> 20:54.260
Uncle Xie is Wong Fei-hung.

20:54.290 --> 20:55.210
Wong Fei-hung?

20:55.410 --> 20:57.100
The Shadowless Kick.

20:57.140 --> 20:58.780
You... I dare you say that to me again!

21:01.530 --> 21:03.220
We can't count on the ships anymore.

21:03.390 --> 21:04.950
We need to think of some other way to make money.

21:05.590 --> 21:07.820
Maybe we don't have to give her money.

21:08.630 --> 21:09.910
What do you mean?

21:10.810 --> 21:12.920
When we were little, you bought her a schoolbag.

21:13.770 --> 21:15.890
She didn't say anything at the moment.

21:16.280 --> 21:17.590
She saved her pocket money for a year

21:17.590 --> 21:18.710
and collected and sold Coke cans.

21:18.710 --> 21:19.510
You remember, right?

21:19.510 --> 21:21.770
In the end, she paid you back with a Casio digital watch.

21:21.800 --> 21:23.360
This shows she doesn't like owing favors.

21:23.390 --> 21:25.020
But we can't just ignore her situation, can we?

21:25.850 --> 21:28.240
As the saying goes, give a man a fish and you feed him for a day; teach a man to fish and you feed him for a lifetime.

21:28.270 --> 21:29.500
Rather than giving her money,

21:29.780 --> 21:31.700
maybe it's better to help her find a way to make money.

21:31.820 --> 21:33.240
She's in her final year of senior high school.

21:33.520 --> 21:34.750
This year is especially important.

21:34.750 --> 21:35.590
She can't be distracted.

21:36.310 --> 21:37.470
She's in the key class at No. 1 High School,

21:37.510 --> 21:38.540
and she made it to the top three.

21:38.560 --> 21:40.230
With a bit more effort, she could get into a top university.

21:40.990 --> 21:41.840
If worst comes to worst, I'll sell

21:41.870 --> 21:43.800
my equipment in the game Fantasy Westward Journey.

21:44.110 --> 21:45.580
My five-digit QQ number

21:45.610 --> 21:46.700
should be worth something.

21:47.840 --> 21:50.080
My dad's Jialing motorcycle that he never rides

21:50.100 --> 21:51.180
can also be sold.

21:51.210 --> 21:52.330
No need, I have a plan.

21:53.160 --> 21:54.350
What kind of plan?

21:54.590 --> 21:55.500
Do you need my help?

21:55.540 --> 21:56.110
No.

21:56.150 --> 21:58.300
The only thing I need you to do is to keep your mouth shut.

21:58.670 --> 21:59.200
That's right.

21:59.380 --> 22:00.970
We must keep this under wraps and not let anything slip,

22:01.000 --> 22:02.050
especially to Siyi.

22:02.190 --> 22:03.670
What could I possibly say?

22:03.870 --> 22:04.430
"Siyi.

22:04.430 --> 22:06.070
Wanghe tried to steal oil for you

22:06.110 --> 22:07.730
and almost got caught by the police."

22:07.770 --> 22:08.890
Do you think I'm stupid?

22:11.320 --> 22:12.690
You went to steal oil?

22:12.720 --> 22:13.430
No, I didn't.

22:13.460 --> 22:14.220
Of course not.

22:14.250 --> 22:15.700
We were just taking a walk and happened to pass by.

22:15.720 --> 22:16.030
Right?

22:16.060 --> 22:18.520
Yes, these... These are all things we picked up.

22:20.090 --> 22:20.710
Siyi!

22:20.940 --> 22:21.430
Siyi. Siyi.

22:21.510 --> 22:21.870
Stop hitting him.

22:21.870 --> 22:22.550
Siyi!

22:22.550 --> 22:23.580
Wanghe was just trying to help you.

22:23.580 --> 22:24.790
He was worried you'd sell blood.

22:24.790 --> 22:25.310
Yes, right.

22:25.310 --> 22:26.650
Then the police came.

22:26.710 --> 22:27.590
And then the police left.

22:27.590 --> 22:28.110
It was a false alarm.

22:28.110 --> 22:29.070
Right, right, it was a false alarm.

22:29.070 --> 22:29.700
Yes.

22:29.730 --> 22:30.570
Siyi.

22:30.590 --> 22:32.350
I'm fine. You don't need to worry about me.

22:32.380 --> 22:33.990
From now on, don't interfere with my business.

22:34.010 --> 22:35.610
Xie Wanghe, you'd better watch yourself.

22:38.240 --> 22:39.010
Siyi!

22:45.910 --> 22:47.490
Why are you looking at me?

23:05.830 --> 23:07.090
Siyi.

23:07.590 --> 23:08.580
What's wrong?

23:11.490 --> 23:12.600
Let me see.

23:14.650 --> 23:16.320
You're crying?

23:16.350 --> 23:17.740
Alright. Alright.

23:18.330 --> 23:19.290
Who did you have a fight with?

23:19.310 --> 23:21.110
You had a fight with Wanghe, didn't you?

23:21.150 --> 23:22.300
No.

23:22.470 --> 23:23.390
No?

23:23.410 --> 23:24.500
If not, then why did you say

23:24.530 --> 23:25.990
'Watch yourself' to him?

23:32.170 --> 23:33.470
I'm not deaf.

23:33.470 --> 23:35.030
I heard everything.

23:36.620 --> 23:38.320
I'll go talk to Wanghe's mother then.

23:38.340 --> 23:39.630
How dare he mistreat my granddaughter?

23:39.660 --> 23:40.370
I'll give him a beating.

23:40.410 --> 23:42.410
Grandma, Grandma, it's not like that.

23:42.440 --> 23:44.630
He really didn't mistreat me.

23:44.920 --> 23:47.360
His heart is in the right place. It's just he's an idiot.

23:47.380 --> 23:49.690
He's always doing inexplicably stupid things.

23:50.580 --> 23:52.310
So no one mistreated you?

23:54.150 --> 23:56.180
Wanghe has been like that since he was little.

23:56.200 --> 23:57.480
A bit of a fool.

23:57.630 --> 23:59.990
He becomes a scatterbrain every time he sees you.

24:00.020 --> 24:01.250
You might not see it,

24:01.270 --> 24:03.500
but I can.

24:03.630 --> 24:06.140
Don't you remember? When you were little, to cheer you up,

24:06.170 --> 24:08.580
he almost crippled himself.

24:09.270 --> 24:12.380
You might not see it, but I can.

24:18.240 --> 24:19.230
Siyi.

24:20.490 --> 24:22.210
Why are you so late, Wanghe?

24:22.430 --> 24:23.760
We're almost done eating.

24:23.780 --> 24:25.110
It's okay. I'm not hungry.

24:25.680 --> 24:27.030
Let me ask you a question.

24:27.860 --> 24:28.980
Do you all know Sun Wukong?

24:29.000 --> 24:30.280
Sure we do.

24:30.830 --> 24:33.080
Then do you know how Sun Wukong flies?

24:33.120 --> 24:34.440
On his somersault cloud.

24:34.570 --> 24:35.360
Correct.

24:36.100 --> 24:37.560
Well, what I have in my hand

24:37.590 --> 24:39.080
is a seven-colored auspicious cloud.

24:39.180 --> 24:40.430
I can fly too.

24:40.830 --> 24:42.760
Xie Wanghe, you're just bragging.

24:43.510 --> 24:44.390
You don't believe me, right?

24:44.410 --> 24:44.990
No, we don't.

24:45.010 --> 24:45.810
No.

24:45.940 --> 24:46.990
Follow me!

24:47.490 --> 24:48.540
-Let's go.
-Let's go.

24:51.730 --> 24:56.860
[Dangerous behavior. Do not imitate.]

25:00.010 --> 25:01.090
I'm coming!

25:13.940 --> 25:14.620
Does it hurt?

25:16.270 --> 25:16.860
Are you okay?

25:16.950 --> 25:18.460
-Are you alright?
-Are you okay?

25:18.480 --> 25:19.830
-Are you alright?
-Are you okay?

25:19.830 --> 25:21.110
Are you okay, Wanghe?

25:22.280 --> 25:23.960
I was just messing with you guys.

25:24.600 --> 25:25.860
It hurt like hell when I fell earlier,

25:25.910 --> 25:26.990
but it doesn't hurt anymore.

25:27.060 --> 25:28.710
The anesthesia hasn't worn off yet, right?

25:28.740 --> 25:30.580
It'll be very painful once it wears off.

25:30.600 --> 25:32.230
It's fine. I'm not afraid of pain.

25:32.410 --> 25:33.690
You're not afraid of pain?

25:33.720 --> 25:35.080
Then why did you cry?

25:38.620 --> 25:39.840
Who cried?

25:39.860 --> 25:40.900
You didn't cry.

25:40.990 --> 25:42.480
It's just your eyes were sweating.

25:50.590 --> 25:52.430
Can you stop doing this in the future?

25:54.020 --> 25:54.620
What did I do?

25:54.660 --> 25:56.830
Being naughty and making adults angry.

25:56.850 --> 25:58.480
You were lucky this time.

25:58.590 --> 25:59.340
You only broke your leg.

25:59.380 --> 26:01.350
If you had fallen headfirst, you would have died.

26:01.370 --> 26:02.370
Don't worry.

26:02.400 --> 26:03.890
I'm a lucky person with a charmed life.

26:03.910 --> 26:04.670
Shut up!

26:06.690 --> 26:08.050
This time you broke your leg,

26:08.070 --> 26:09.860
your mom's eyes are swollen from crying at home.

26:09.880 --> 26:11.590
Grow up a bit, okay?

26:11.810 --> 26:12.750
Have you all forgotten?

26:12.750 --> 26:13.810
Didn't the teacher say

26:13.830 --> 26:15.720
science comes from practice?

26:15.820 --> 26:17.110
Aren't human inventions done

26:17.130 --> 26:19.010
thanks to brave people like me?

26:19.050 --> 26:20.290
They are brave,

26:20.310 --> 26:21.590
while you're just trying to get yourself killed.

26:21.620 --> 26:23.650
If you don't understand, don't talk nonsense, okay?

26:23.680 --> 26:24.840
You understand?

26:24.990 --> 26:25.710
Of course I understand.

26:25.710 --> 26:27.150
Do you know the principle of the lightning conductor?

26:27.150 --> 26:28.310
We learned about it in science class.

26:28.310 --> 26:29.110
Then explain it.

26:29.150 --> 26:29.860
What principle is that?

26:30.230 --> 26:31.480
As if you know.

26:31.510 --> 26:32.850
Of course I know.

26:34.490 --> 26:36.820
Can someone get me a piece of wire?

26:37.250 --> 26:38.050
I'll go.

26:38.080 --> 26:39.450
You all know about conductors and insulators, right?

26:39.470 --> 26:41.160
The plaster on my leg is an insulator.

26:41.190 --> 26:43.270
If I electrify the wire, since the plaster insulates,

26:43.310 --> 26:45.120
there's no way I can get electrocuted.

26:45.120 --> 26:46.510
Let me demonstrate for you.

26:46.530 --> 26:47.460
Everyone step back.

26:55.560 --> 26:56.950
Witness with me

26:56.970 --> 26:58.780
the great power of science.

27:11.170 --> 27:14.920
[Dangerous behavior. Do not imitate.]

27:14.680 --> 27:15.710
Watch carefully.

27:28.880 --> 27:30.190
-Doctor!
-Doctor!

27:30.230 --> 27:31.300
Help!

27:31.330 --> 27:33.510
-Help!
-Help!

27:59.870 --> 28:00.550
Mom.

28:02.700 --> 28:03.870
You are still up?

28:08.340 --> 28:09.680
I'm used to it.

28:10.000 --> 28:11.120
Son.

28:11.330 --> 28:12.050
How about

28:12.070 --> 28:13.800
I rent a small house for you?

28:13.830 --> 28:16.070
Staying up like this too often can lead to mental exhaustion.

28:17.390 --> 28:18.330
Rent a house?

28:18.360 --> 28:19.520
The two of us move out

28:19.830 --> 28:21.230
and leave Dad alone at home to sleep?

28:24.520 --> 28:26.330
It'd be better to have him move out.

28:27.510 --> 28:28.360
From now on,

28:28.380 --> 28:29.700
let him sleep on the ship.

28:29.920 --> 28:31.210
Ask him not to come home unless necessary.

28:36.250 --> 28:37.410
Did we make any profit this month?

28:37.430 --> 28:38.780
It's good enough if we didn't lose money.

28:39.240 --> 28:40.940
The gas price has increased again.

28:40.980 --> 28:42.230
Labor costs are high too.

28:42.240 --> 28:44.850
There's no shortage of work at construction sites in the city.

28:45.410 --> 28:46.840
I've been thinking,

28:46.880 --> 28:48.640
if worst comes to worst,

28:50.190 --> 28:52.040
we can't keep this ship anymore.

28:52.480 --> 28:54.000
We'll sell it, withdraw our shares,

28:54.030 --> 28:56.660
and switch to a heavy truck for land transport.

28:57.550 --> 28:59.170
Help me look it up online later.

28:59.380 --> 29:00.620
No, Mom, don't.

29:03.940 --> 29:05.550
Why are you unhappy about it?

29:05.580 --> 29:07.190
Weren't you the one who kept telling me

29:07.950 --> 29:10.510
to cut our losses if river transport wasn't profitable?

29:11.710 --> 29:12.300
What happened?

29:13.030 --> 29:13.850
You've changed your mind?

29:14.180 --> 29:16.050
It's not that I've changed my mind.

29:17.480 --> 29:19.090
I'm just worried Dad won't be happy.

29:19.930 --> 29:20.820
Normally,

29:20.870 --> 29:22.710
I feel like Dad is always listless.

29:23.310 --> 29:24.700
But once he gets on the ship,

29:25.190 --> 29:26.370
he becomes full of energy,

29:26.400 --> 29:27.800
like he's a different person.

29:34.040 --> 29:35.550
Your dad once told me

29:36.210 --> 29:39.120
that in his previous life, he was a loach.

29:39.740 --> 29:41.250
He can't stay too far from water,

29:41.560 --> 29:42.540
or

29:43.180 --> 29:44.500
he'll suffocate.

29:53.260 --> 29:54.070
Mom.

29:56.080 --> 29:57.060
I'm sorry.

29:58.250 --> 29:59.630
I'm so useless.

29:59.920 --> 30:02.340
What's wrong? Why are you saying such things?

30:03.850 --> 30:06.370
Back in the day, a lot of people

30:06.390 --> 30:07.730
were already successful at my age.

30:08.710 --> 30:10.170
They could take care of their families.

30:11.130 --> 30:12.770
But I'm still in school,

30:12.990 --> 30:14.690
and I can't help with anything.

30:19.830 --> 30:21.290
Silly boy.

30:21.670 --> 30:23.110
The fact that you care

30:23.890 --> 30:25.990
is enough to make me content.

30:28.230 --> 30:28.830
Mom.

30:30.020 --> 30:31.010
Please rest assured.

30:31.690 --> 30:33.240
I'll definitely be successful in the future.

30:33.530 --> 30:36.410
I'll make you and Dad proud of me.

30:36.660 --> 30:38.220
In the future, when you go out,

30:38.320 --> 30:40.790
you can have your nose in the air.

30:43.190 --> 30:43.790
Alright.

30:44.310 --> 30:45.560
Having our nose in the air.

30:45.790 --> 30:47.860
I'm Xie Wanghe's mother.

30:54.120 --> 30:55.120
Let me help you calculate.

31:15.640 --> 31:17.100
When is Grandma coming?

31:17.840 --> 31:19.440
Don't bring this up to me.

31:19.550 --> 31:20.820
Just thinking about them coming

31:20.820 --> 31:22.170
makes me shudder all over.

31:25.170 --> 31:27.220
Last time when your grandma left,

31:27.340 --> 31:28.590
she complained to you about being poor again, didn't she?

31:29.650 --> 31:30.610
No, she didn't.

31:31.230 --> 31:32.310
I heard it all.

31:33.210 --> 31:34.290
Saying things like

31:34.520 --> 31:36.630
the roof of her house was leaking again,

31:37.080 --> 31:38.460
the villagers didn't care,

31:38.490 --> 31:40.680
and they were demolishing her pigsty forcibly and such.

31:42.030 --> 31:43.480
Why are they so mean?

31:43.680 --> 31:44.560
Nonsense.

31:44.940 --> 31:47.040
Your grandma built the pigsty right in the wind's path.

31:47.110 --> 31:48.860
When the wind blows, it stinks up the whole village.

31:49.270 --> 31:50.550
How can the villagers not hate it?

31:51.190 --> 31:53.520
But she left you the family heirloom.

31:54.780 --> 31:56.250
A jade bracelet.

31:56.970 --> 31:58.360
At our wedding,

31:58.690 --> 32:00.570
she wrapped it in layers and layers,

32:00.600 --> 32:02.080
and solemnly handed it to me,

32:02.190 --> 32:03.480
saying it was

32:03.870 --> 32:04.990
a mutton-fat jade

32:05.360 --> 32:06.770
from the Han Dynasty.

32:07.550 --> 32:08.590
I was so happy.

32:09.230 --> 32:10.480
Later, when I had it appraised,

32:11.340 --> 32:12.520
it turned out to be majestic white jade.

32:13.060 --> 32:15.420
It's even cheaper than this bag we are making.

32:31.210 --> 32:32.260
Mom.

32:33.960 --> 32:36.470
How much can we earn from this batch?

32:36.490 --> 32:37.370
Why do you care?

32:39.350 --> 32:41.280
How much can I get?

32:41.310 --> 32:42.420
How much do you want?

32:42.450 --> 32:43.210
200.

32:43.250 --> 32:44.370
How about 250?

32:44.390 --> 32:45.560
Sure.

32:46.240 --> 32:47.300
Go look in the mirror.

32:48.350 --> 32:50.210
You'll see an idiot staring back at you.

32:52.300 --> 32:54.770
Mom, I'm not asking for much.

32:54.800 --> 32:55.550
200.

32:55.640 --> 32:56.860
Just 200.

32:57.020 --> 32:58.550
Please.

32:58.550 --> 33:01.160
What does a student like you need so much money for?

33:01.290 --> 33:02.360
I want to buy jeans.

33:02.400 --> 33:04.410
Didn't I just buy you a pair last year?

33:05.590 --> 33:06.990
The style is outdated.

33:07.010 --> 33:08.280
It looks a bit unfashionable.

33:08.470 --> 33:10.680
You can't blame the clothes if the person wearing them is unfashionable.

33:10.930 --> 33:12.330
Look at Siyi.

33:12.360 --> 33:13.710
Even if she wears a big cotton padded jacket,

33:13.870 --> 33:16.500
she can still manage to look like she's from Milan or Paris.

33:20.340 --> 33:22.800
So who do you think is prettier, me or her?

33:25.400 --> 33:27.120
How can you ask such a question?

33:27.210 --> 33:28.480
Who gave you the courage?

33:28.560 --> 33:29.630
Was it Fish Leong?

33:29.690 --> 33:30.500
Mom!

33:30.540 --> 33:31.640
Alright. Alright.

33:31.750 --> 33:32.830
You're prettier.

33:32.830 --> 33:34.590
Of course my daughter is prettier.

33:34.940 --> 33:35.700
You're youthful,

33:37.270 --> 33:38.170
radiant,

33:38.400 --> 33:39.380
and smart.

33:39.430 --> 33:41.100
Of course my daughter is the prettiest.

33:44.360 --> 33:45.410
Anyway,

33:45.430 --> 33:47.260
I have a better figure than Siyi.

33:47.310 --> 33:48.460
My legs are longer than hers,

33:48.500 --> 33:49.440
and my waist is slimmer too.

33:49.560 --> 33:51.290
If your grades were better than hers,

33:51.430 --> 33:53.040
let alone jeans,

33:53.060 --> 33:54.350
I'd even buy you a cell phone.

33:56.830 --> 33:58.390
Being good at studies is useless.

33:59.780 --> 34:00.800
Why is that?

34:01.340 --> 34:03.410
Wanghe's grades are at the bottom of our grade,

34:03.430 --> 34:04.920
but in a few years,

34:04.950 --> 34:07.150
he'll definitely be

34:07.170 --> 34:08.610
the most, most promising one among all the students.

34:09.080 --> 34:10.260
One 'most' is not enough?

34:10.300 --> 34:11.300
You had to use it twice?

34:12.429 --> 34:14.630
He has so many brilliant ideas in his head.

34:14.719 --> 34:17.130
Any one of his ideas could make a lot of money.

34:18.350 --> 34:19.230
You know what?

34:19.270 --> 34:21.130
Today, Mr. Xu gave him a hard time,

34:21.190 --> 34:22.949
but Wanghe left him speechless.

34:23.219 --> 34:24.179
It was so satisfying.

34:26.100 --> 34:27.239
Quite promising.

34:28.230 --> 34:29.360
What about you?

34:29.670 --> 34:31.650
You can't get into college,

34:31.840 --> 34:33.179
your family is so poor,

34:33.310 --> 34:34.550
you're not gentle,

34:34.670 --> 34:35.800
and you don't want to work.

34:35.870 --> 34:37.070
So, in the future,

34:37.520 --> 34:38.770
who will want to marry you?

34:39.429 --> 34:41.409
Who says I can't work?

34:41.909 --> 34:43.469
Granny Ma said

34:43.750 --> 34:45.760
my fried radish cakes are much better than Siyi's.

34:46.000 --> 34:47.530
Well, that's true.

34:47.750 --> 34:48.659
In the future,

34:48.659 --> 34:50.949
Siyi will get into a top university,

34:51.320 --> 34:53.900
and Wanghe will make a lot of money.

34:54.110 --> 34:55.340
By then, he'll drive a Mercedes

34:55.590 --> 34:57.060
to pick up Siyi

34:57.190 --> 34:58.740
and come to your little stall

34:58.950 --> 35:00.310
to eat your fried radish cakes.

35:01.550 --> 35:04.120
Don't forget to give them a discount.

35:05.090 --> 35:11.850
♫Oh, my dear dad♫

35:13.450 --> 35:20.250
♫I love that handsome boy♫

35:21.520 --> 35:28.430
♫I'm willing to go to Rosa Gate♫

35:29.640 --> 35:34.950
♫And buy a wedding ring♫

35:34.980 --> 35:35.740
Keep the change.

35:35.810 --> 35:43.280
♫Yes, I must go♫

35:44.880 --> 35:49.760
♫If you don't agree♫

36:05.300 --> 36:06.160
Why hasn't she come out yet?

36:15.610 --> 36:16.510
Where's Siyi?

36:19.840 --> 36:21.070
Her grandma said

36:21.280 --> 36:23.220
she left by herself early in the morning.

36:23.550 --> 36:24.490
Is something wrong?

36:24.590 --> 36:26.110
Would she have left on her own if nothing was wrong?

36:26.140 --> 36:26.990
Full of nonsense.

36:27.020 --> 36:28.360
So she's really angry with us?

36:28.380 --> 36:29.730
You're talking nonsense too.

36:30.120 --> 36:31.470
If Wanghe dared to treat me like this,

36:31.470 --> 36:32.230
I'd beat him up too.

36:32.270 --> 36:33.790
I'd give him a flying kick right away.

36:36.630 --> 36:37.710
We've waited here for you for ages.

36:37.750 --> 36:38.630
Why can't you wait for me?

36:40.590 --> 36:41.890
So she's really angry?

36:42.160 --> 36:43.210
She really doesn't want us to interfere anymore?

36:43.230 --> 36:44.760
That can't be, right?

37:05.610 --> 37:07.560
It's time to eat after finishing this.

37:11.600 --> 37:12.520
Lao'er.

37:12.540 --> 37:13.390
Let's go.

37:13.670 --> 37:14.390
Time to eat.

37:24.150 --> 37:24.590
Come on.

37:24.620 --> 37:25.400
Give it to me.

37:25.510 --> 37:26.030
Alright.

37:26.270 --> 37:27.140
Here you go.

37:32.400 --> 37:33.800
Peanuts.

37:34.950 --> 37:35.670
Beef.

37:41.240 --> 37:42.240
What's wrong?

37:43.100 --> 37:44.110
Got bitten again?

37:45.050 --> 37:46.620
That woman.

37:47.610 --> 37:48.640
She bites when she's happy,

37:48.670 --> 37:49.730
and when she's not happy,

37:49.770 --> 37:50.520
she bites too.

37:50.590 --> 37:51.550
So this time, was it

37:51.550 --> 37:52.960
because she was happy or unhappy?

37:54.770 --> 37:55.850
A mix of both.

37:57.640 --> 37:59.760
You can't keep living like this, right?

38:00.490 --> 38:01.810
I've told her a million times.

38:01.880 --> 38:03.940
She just can't break this habit.

38:04.820 --> 38:06.220
This time it's not so bad.

38:06.280 --> 38:07.870
Look, it's not even swollen.

38:08.180 --> 38:09.960
Last time, it swelled up this big.

38:10.070 --> 38:11.870
Took a whole week to go down.

38:12.600 --> 38:13.870
Do you know why?

38:14.000 --> 38:14.880
Why?

38:15.030 --> 38:16.040
Let me tell you.

38:16.410 --> 38:19.310
Human teeth and dog teeth are both poisonous.

38:20.260 --> 38:20.920
Really?

38:20.940 --> 38:21.950
Of course.

38:22.790 --> 38:24.520
Should I get a shot then?

38:25.310 --> 38:26.590
I've heard of rabies vaccine,

38:26.630 --> 38:28.620
but I've never heard of the vaccine for crazy people.

38:28.850 --> 38:29.950
But since you keep getting bitten,

38:29.950 --> 38:32.070
I suppose you should have developed antibodies by now.

38:34.510 --> 38:36.640
Next time she does this to you,

38:36.670 --> 38:38.050
give her a good scare.

38:39.070 --> 38:40.130
How should I scare her?

38:40.170 --> 38:41.270
Threaten to divorce her.

38:41.670 --> 38:42.470
That won't work.

38:42.490 --> 38:44.510
What if she agrees?

38:44.530 --> 38:46.250
How is that possible?

38:47.430 --> 38:48.180
Women don't divorce

38:48.230 --> 38:49.520
at the drop of a hat, okay?

38:49.690 --> 38:51.520
You're giving them too much credit.

38:52.050 --> 38:52.760
However,

38:52.780 --> 38:53.950
no matter what,

38:53.950 --> 38:56.390
you need to set rules at home.

38:58.390 --> 38:59.120
So

38:59.150 --> 39:00.420
you have rules in your house?

39:00.450 --> 39:01.650
Of course.

39:01.740 --> 39:03.220
Go ask Haihong if she dares

39:03.240 --> 39:05.540
to raise her voice at me.

39:05.580 --> 39:07.260
She'd be out of line if she did.

39:07.390 --> 39:08.290
If you don't believe me, go ask her

39:08.570 --> 39:09.550
who the boss at home

39:09.870 --> 39:10.970
is.

39:14.900 --> 39:15.870
You need to let him know

39:15.870 --> 39:17.000
that at home,

39:17.110 --> 39:18.520
women are the boss.

39:18.910 --> 39:19.910
In front of men,

39:20.190 --> 39:21.750
we need to establish rules.

39:22.100 --> 39:23.960
Anything is allowed at home,

39:24.320 --> 39:26.080
but absolutely no physical violence.

39:27.940 --> 39:29.650
Yes, right here.

39:29.780 --> 39:30.730
The two of us

39:30.770 --> 39:32.760
just got carried away in our conversation.

39:33.110 --> 39:34.440
And he had been drinking.

39:34.460 --> 39:35.470
It wasn't intentional.

39:36.430 --> 39:37.710
That's still not acceptable.

39:38.410 --> 39:39.210
Next time,

39:39.510 --> 39:40.390
if he lays a hand on you again,

39:40.580 --> 39:41.980
you come stay at our place.

39:42.010 --> 39:43.230
If he dares to come to our place to get you,

39:43.230 --> 39:44.670
you'll see how I'll deal with him.

39:45.030 --> 39:45.900
Actually,

39:46.820 --> 39:48.120
I understand him to some extent.

39:48.550 --> 39:50.380
Recently, he's been having a hard time at work.

39:50.530 --> 39:51.570
He's under a lot of pressure.

39:51.830 --> 39:52.670
Just because

39:52.670 --> 39:53.440
he's frustrated outside,

39:53.510 --> 39:54.920
he comes home to take it out on his wife?

39:55.430 --> 39:56.320
That's sick.

39:59.970 --> 40:00.740
Shao.

40:03.190 --> 40:04.130
I really envy you.

40:05.020 --> 40:06.430
What do you envy about me?

40:06.790 --> 40:08.070
I envy you for your wife.

40:13.170 --> 40:14.310
Your wife

40:14.310 --> 40:15.990
cooks various kinds of delicious food for you every day.

40:16.890 --> 40:17.830
As for my wife,

40:18.820 --> 40:20.850
she'd probably burn down the kitchen just frying an egg.

40:24.920 --> 40:26.120
What delicious food are you having today?

40:26.680 --> 40:27.410
Share some with me.

40:34.080 --> 40:35.280
She had a fever yesterday.

40:35.380 --> 40:36.610
She didn't have time to cook.

40:36.990 --> 40:39.150
Why don't you hurry home and take care of her then?

40:39.260 --> 40:40.460
What a great opportunity.

40:40.490 --> 40:41.590
Show her some love.

40:42.510 --> 40:43.950
We've been married for so long. We don't care about this anymore.

40:43.990 --> 40:45.350
The longer you've been married,

40:45.350 --> 40:46.890
the more she cares about this.

40:47.630 --> 40:48.970
And you need to have a sense of ritual.

40:49.310 --> 40:50.950
Remind yourself and your partner

40:50.950 --> 40:52.500
that your feelings for each other haven't faded.

40:55.580 --> 40:56.990
Is that really necessary?

40:58.150 --> 40:59.180
Women

40:59.230 --> 41:00.230
are emotional creatures.

41:00.370 --> 41:01.720
If you show just a little bit of care,

41:01.790 --> 41:02.790
they'll be incredibly touched.

41:03.000 --> 41:04.030
My wife is just like that.

41:04.070 --> 41:05.070
She really falls for this kind of thing.

41:22.860 --> 41:24.220
Granny Ma, are you going home?

41:22.870 --> 41:27.070
[Clock Fixing]

41:24.400 --> 41:26.250
I'm going to get something.

41:27.990 --> 41:29.130
Yanlin.

41:30.270 --> 41:31.690
Granny Ma.

41:32.350 --> 41:33.070
You've closed up? Let me help you.

41:33.090 --> 41:35.350
No, I'm just going home to get some stuff.

41:38.300 --> 41:39.740
Yanlin.

41:40.220 --> 41:41.170
Well...

41:41.180 --> 41:42.230
When Zhimei left,

41:42.270 --> 41:44.230
why didn't you see her off?

41:45.300 --> 41:46.500
She didn't ask me to.

41:49.740 --> 41:50.700
From now on,

41:50.730 --> 41:53.280
come by my place every day after work.

41:50.880 --> 41:57.390
[Huihuang Tailor Shop]

41:53.630 --> 41:54.990
Before Zhimei left,

41:55.070 --> 41:56.350
she went to see an experienced traditional Chinese medicine doctor

41:56.390 --> 41:57.670
who prescribed some medicine for you.

41:59.070 --> 42:00.560
It's for liver protection.

42:00.590 --> 42:01.640
She asked me

42:01.660 --> 42:03.240
to brew it for you every day

42:03.290 --> 42:04.560
and make sure you drink it.

42:04.600 --> 42:06.000
She said you don't listen to your father,

42:06.040 --> 42:07.360
but you'll listen to me.

42:08.230 --> 42:09.830
My liver is fine.

42:09.870 --> 42:12.370
She's just concerned about you.

42:14.190 --> 42:15.970
Being a married couple is like this.

42:16.120 --> 42:19.000
It's not easy, you know.

42:19.030 --> 42:20.820
You support each other

42:20.840 --> 42:22.630
and help each other.

42:22.660 --> 42:24.300
How great this is.

42:24.320 --> 42:26.670
Call her more often from now on.

42:26.810 --> 42:28.380
Otherwise, being so far apart,

42:28.550 --> 42:30.400
your feelings might fade.

42:30.680 --> 42:31.440
Right.

42:32.660 --> 42:35.560
But it's not like she's never coming back, right?

42:35.630 --> 42:37.200
Yes, I know.

42:37.230 --> 42:38.670
You still need to call her.

42:38.700 --> 42:39.690
I know, I know.

42:39.720 --> 42:41.500
I'll call her in a bit.

42:42.050 --> 42:44.000
Alright, give it to me.

42:45.600 --> 42:46.200
Be careful.

42:46.230 --> 42:46.980
Alright.
